          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_first_raw_subgraph_densities_graph",
          "text": "The first uses the raw subgraph densities, or graph moments; the second converts them into graph cumulants, a combinatorial analogue of mean, variance, and skew for networks.",
